  m_Text: "<b>\U0001F3AF First Blood</b> - <color=#888888>\U0001F512 CH\u01AFA \u0110\u1EA0T</color>\r\n<i>Ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn</i>\n\r\n<b>\U0001F6E1\uFE0F Iron Wall</b> - <color=#888888>\U0001F512 CH\u01AFA \u0110\u1EA0T</color>\r\n<i>K\xEDch ho\u1EA1t Khi\xEAn b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng</i>\n\r\n<b>\u26A1 Overcharged</b> - <color=#00FF88>\u2713 \u0110\xC3 M\u1EDE KH\xD3A</color>\r\n<i>K\xEDch ho\u1EA1t h\u1ECFa l\u1EF1c Triple Shot 3 tia</i>\n\r\n<b>\U0001F4A3 Tactical Nuke</b> - <color=#00FF88>\u2713 \u0110\xC3 M\u1EDE KH\xD3A</color>\r\n<i>S\u1EED d\u1EE5ng bom h\u1EE7y di\u1EC7t EMP Shockwave</i>\n\r\n<b>\U0001F525 Combo Master</b> - <color=#00FF88>\u2713 \u0110\xC3 M\u1EDE KH\xD3A</color>\r\n<i>\u0110\u1EA1t chu\u1ED7i Combo 5x li\xEAn ti\u1EBFp</i>\n\r\n<b>\U0001F6F8 Boss Slayer</b> - <color=#888888>\U0001F512 CH\u01AFA \u0110\u1EA0T</color>\r\n<i>\u0110\xE1nh b\u1EA1i t\xE0u M\u1EB9 Red UFO Mothership</i>\n\r\n<b>\U0001F4AF Star Veteran</b> - <color=#888888>\U0001F512 CH\u01AFA \u0110\u1EA0T</color>\r\n<i>\u0110\u1EA1t tr\xEAn 200 \u0111i\u1EC3m s\u1ED1 trong m\u1ED9t tr\u1EADn</i>\n\r\n"
